<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>SHM-AI Structural Inspection Report — {{ asset_id }}</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 2cm 2.2cm;
            @bottom-center {
                content: "SHM-AI Structural Inspection Report  |  Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);
                font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
                font-size: 8pt;
                color: #6c757d;
            }
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: #212529;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        /* ── Header ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .report-header {
            background-color: #1e3a5f;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 18px 22px 14px 22px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .report-header h1 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            margin: 0 0 3px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .report-header .subtitle {
            font-size: 9pt;
            color: #adb5bd;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        }

        .report-header .meta-row {
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            color: #ced4da;
            border-top: 1px solid #2c5282;
            padding-top: 8px;
        }

        .report-header .meta-item {
            display: inline;
            margin-right: 20px;
        }

        /* ── Sections ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1e3a5f;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #1e3a5f;
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .section-body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 3px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
        }

        /* ── Health score ────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .health-score-label {
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            color: #6c757d;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .health-score {
            font-size: 30pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1e3a5f;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .health-score-unit {
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: #6c757d;
            vertical-align: super;
        }

        /* ── Badges ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .risk-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 3px 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .action-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 16px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* ── Info rows ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .info-row {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #495057;
            display: inline-block;
            min-width: 200px;
        }

        .info-value {
            color: #212529;
        }

        /* ── Tables ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 9pt;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #1e3a5f;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        td {
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        tr:nth-child(even) td {
            background-color: #eef2f7;
        }

        /* ── Escalation trace ────────────────────────────────────── */
        .trace-block {
            margin-top: 10px;
            border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            padding-top: 8px;
        }

        .trace-applied {
            color: #e74c3c;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .trace-not-applied {
            color: #6c757d;
        }

        /* ── Cost ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .cost-range {
            font-size: 15pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1e3a5f;
        }

        .cost-disclaimer {
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #6c757d;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .cost-basis {
            font-size: 9pt;
            color: #495057;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        /* ── Maintenance flag ────────────────────────────────────── */
        .flag-yes {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #e74c3c;
        }

        .flag-no {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #27ae60;
        }

        /* ── Placeholder ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .placeholder {
            border: 2px dashed #adb5bd;
            border-radius: 3px;
            padding: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6c757d;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }

        .placeholder-title {
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6c757d;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .placeholder-note {
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* ── Footer ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
        .report-footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            padding-top: 8px;
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #6c757d;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ HEADER ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="report-header">
    <h1>SHM-AI Structural Inspection Report</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">AI-Directed Predictive Maintenance &amp; Structural Health Monitoring Platform</p>
    <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-item"><strong>Asset ID:</strong> {{ asset_id }}</span>
        <span class="meta-item"><strong>Inspection ID:</strong> {{ inspection_id }}</span>
        <span class="meta-item"><strong>Asset Type:</strong> {{ asset_type | upper }}</span>
        <span class="meta-item"><strong>Generated:</strong> {{ generated_at_utc }}</span>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ HEALTH ASSESSMENT ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Health Assessment</div>
    <div class="section-body">
        <span class="health-score-label">Composite Structural Health Score&nbsp;(0 = critical deterioration &nbsp;|&nbsp; 100 = pristine)</span>
        <span class="health-score">{{ health_score_formatted }}</span>
        <span class="health-score-unit"> / 100</span>
        <span class="risk-badge" style="background-color: {{ risk_level_color }};">{{ risk_level | upper }}</span>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ DEFECT SEVERITY BREAKDOWN ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Defect Severity Breakdown</div>
    {% if severity_breakdown %}
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Defect Category</th>
                <th>Severity</th>
                <th style="text-align: center;">Observations</th>
                <th style="text-align: right;">Total Area (mm²)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for row in severity_breakdown %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ row.category | replace("_", " ") | title }}</td>
                <td>{{ row.severity | upper }}</td>
                <td style="text-align: center;">{{ row.observation_count }}</td>
                <td style="text-align: right;">{% if row.area_formatted %}{{ row.area_formatted }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <div class="section-body">No defect observations recorded for this inspection.</div>
    {% endif %}
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ FAILURE MODES ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Identified Structural Failure Modes</div>
    {% if failure_modes %}
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Failure Mode</th>
                <th style="text-align: center;">Confidence</th>
                <th>Description</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for mode in failure_modes %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ mode.category | replace("_", " ") | title }}</td>
                <td style="text-align: center;">{{ mode.confidence_pct }}</td>
                <td>{{ mode.description }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <div class="section-body">No structural failure modes identified.</div>
    {% endif %}
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ MAINTENANCE RECOMMENDATION ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Maintenance Recommendation</div>
    <div class="section-body">
        <div>
            <span class="action-badge" style="background-color: {{ action_color }};">
                {{ recommended_action | replace("_", " ") | upper }}
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Next inspection in:</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{ next_inspection_formatted }} years</span>
        </div>

        <div class="trace-block">
            <strong>Escalation Audit Trace</strong>
            <div class="info-row" style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <span class="info-label">Baseline action (from risk level):</span>
                <span class="info-value">{{ baseline_action | replace("_", " ") | upper }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Stage 2 — Degradation escalation:</span>
                {% if degradation_escalation_applied %}
                <span class="trace-applied">APPLIED — requires_maintenance flag raised action to REPAIR</span>
                {% else %}
                <span class="trace-not-applied">not applied</span>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="info-row">
                <span class="info-label">Stage 3 — Failure-mode escalation:</span>
                {% if failure_mode_escalation_applied %}
                <span class="trace-applied">APPLIED — triggering: {{ triggering_failure_modes | join(", ") | replace("_", " ") | upper }}</span>
                {% else %}
                <span class="trace-not-applied">not applied</span>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ ESTIMATED COST ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Estimated Intervention Cost</div>
    <div class="section-body">
        <div class="cost-disclaimer">Indicative range only — requires review by a qualified quantity surveyor before use in procurement or budgeting.</div>
        <div class="cost-range">{{ cost_currency }}&nbsp;{{ cost_low_formatted }}&nbsp;–&nbsp;{{ cost_high_formatted }}</div>
        <div class="cost-basis"><strong>Basis:</strong> {{ cost_basis }}</div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ MATERIAL DEGRADATION ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Material Degradation Assessment (Phase 4)</div>
    {% if has_degradation %}
    <div class="section-body">
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Carbonation Depth:</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{ degradation.carbonation_depth_formatted }} mm</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Time to Depassivation:</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{ degradation.time_to_depassivation }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Corrosion Initiated:</span>
            <span class="info-value">{% if degradation.corrosion_initiated %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Corrosion Index (0–1):</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{ degradation.corrosion_index_formatted }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Maintenance Required:</span>
            {% if degradation.requires_maintenance %}
            <span class="flag-yes">YES</span>
            {% else %}
            <span class="flag-no">NO</span>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="placeholder">
        <div class="placeholder-title">No Phase 4 Degradation Assessment Available</div>
        <div class="placeholder-note">
            Run a material degradation assessment (ServiceLifeEstimator) and supply the result
            as <em>degradation_report</em> on the RecommendationInput to populate this section.
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ PLACEHOLDER — IMAGE GALLERY ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Defect Image Gallery</div>
    <div class="placeholder">
        <div class="placeholder-title">&#9634; Defect Image Gallery — Pending Phase 2 Integration</div>
        <div class="placeholder-note">
            Annotated defect images will appear here once image paths are available
            on the inspection record (requires Phase 2 vision engine integration).
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ PLACEHOLDER — TREND CHART ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Health Score Trend</div>
    <div class="placeholder">
        <div class="placeholder-title">&#9634; Health Score Trend Chart — Pending Time-Series Data</div>
        <div class="placeholder-note">
            This chart will display the health score history across inspections
            once multi-inspection time-series data is available.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ PLACEHOLDER — SIGN-OFF ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Engineer Sign-Off</div>
    <div class="placeholder">
        <div class="placeholder-title">&#9634; Engineer Review &amp; Sign-Off — Pending Workflow Implementation</div>
        <div class="placeholder-note">
            A reviewing structural engineer must validate these AI-generated recommendations
            before any maintenance work is commissioned. Sign-off workflow is a future milestone.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ REPORT METADATA ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Report Metadata</div>
    <div class="section-body" style="font-size: 8.5pt; color: #495057;">
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Service Version:</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{ service_version }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Report Generator Version:</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{ generator_version }}</span>
        </div>
        {% if engine_versions %}
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Engine Versions:</span>
            <span class="info-value">
                {%- for name, ver in engine_versions.items() %}{{ name }}: {{ ver }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor -%}
            </span>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Generated At (UTC):</span>
            <span class="info-value">{{ generated_at_utc }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════ FOOTER ══════════════════════════ -->
<div class="report-footer">
    <strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong>
    This report is produced by an AI-assisted structural health monitoring system.
    All recommendations, cost estimates, and risk assessments are indicative starting points
    and must be reviewed and validated by a qualified structural engineer before any maintenance
    action is commissioned or any budget committed.
    Cost figures are not derived from real project data and require review by a qualified
    quantity surveyor.
    This report does not constitute professional engineering advice.
</div>

</body>
</html>
